Source: https://datosabiertos.bogota.gov.co/dataset/placa-domiciliaria
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
This corpus samples principal address plates in urban Bogotá, reformats the road/plate fields and expands official road-type abbreviations. It is not national Colombian coverage, a household directory or a surveyed entrance dataset.
